flowchart LR
    A[RSNA DICOM images] --> B[Decode, resize to 224×224, normalize]
    L[RSNA labels and boxes] --> C[Group annotation rows by image ID]
    B --> C
    C --> D[Reproducible stratified split<br/>seed 42 · 80/10/10]
    D --> E[Train split]
    D --> F[Validation split]
    D --> G[Test split]
    E --> H[ImageNet pretrained DenseNet121]
    H --> I[One pneumonia logit]
    I --> J[Weighted BCE · AdamW]
    J --> H
    F --> K[Early stopping and best checkpoint]
    H --> K
    K --> M[Validation threshold sweep<br/>select by F1 · threshold 0.70]
    K --> N[Grad-CAM heatmap]
    N --> O[Adaptive threshold + morphology<br/>connected-component boxes]
    G --> P[Held-out classification metrics]
    M --> P
    G --> O
    L --> Q[Ground-truth boxes, evaluation only]
    Q --> R[IoU: classifier-conditioned<br/>and classifier-independent]
    O --> R
    K --> S[Streamlit image upload demo]
